    "summary": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-19 contains a heap buffer overflow vulnerability in the FTXT encoder due...",
    "details": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-19 contains a heap buffer overflow vulnerability in the FTXT encoder due to missing boundary checks when parsing ftxt:format. Remote attackers can trigger an out of bounds read by crafting malicious FTXT image files to cause denial of service or information disclosure.",
